{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55835","headline":"夜覩豺虎奔至契如庵前自然驯遶因有诗（题拟） · 清豁","name":"夜覩豺虎奔至契如庵前自然驯遶因有诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行不等闲行，谁知去住情。\n一餐犹未饱，万户勿聊生。\n非道应难伏，空拳莫与争。\n龙吟云起处，闲啸两三声。\n（见《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清豁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}